e I'm ahead overall (+350 cumulative) and this is hand 18/20, preserving chips while seeing if my pair of 8s wins is reasonable.\n\nReason: \nWith only a pair of 8s after missing my flush and straight draws, and facing an opponent who has checked every street, I should check to get to showdown at minimal cost. A bet risks getting called or raised by better hands, and the pot is small enough that checking is the safest play to preserve my chip lead going into the final hands.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
